(2. Solution to Question 1: Net Force & Acceleration) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -14 Td
(Given: Mass m = 5.0 kg, Applied Force F_app = 35.0 N, Frictional Resistance f_k = 14.0 N.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -14 Td
(Formula: F_net = F_app - f_k = 35.0 N - 14.0 N = 21.0 N.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -14 Td
(Acceleration: a = F_net / m = 21.0 N / 5.0 kg = 4.20 m/s^2 along horizontal direction.) Tj
